arteries, especially the

462
00:25:26,910 --> 00:25:29,750
mesenteric arteries in the
gastrointestinal circulation.

463
00:25:29,970 --> 00:25:32,710
A common misconception
is that peripheral

464
00:25:32,710 --> 00:25:34,890
refers to the vessels
in the periphery of

465
00:25:34,890 --> 00:25:36,990
our body, such as in
the arms and legs.

466
00:25:37,020 --> 00:25:39,990
But in reality, it's the
small arteries in the

467
00:25:39,990 --> 00:25:42,330
