most to total peripheral

468
00:25:42,330 --> 00:25:46,030
resistance, and they are
known as resistant vessels.

469
00:25:46,270 --> 00:25:49,370
So the key takeaway is
that mesenteric arteries

470
00:25:49,370 --> 00:25:52,110
